---
kind: scene
id: east.portvoltMarket
title: The Portvolt market
on: enterTown
target: town.portvolt
also: true
once: day
when: "clock.weekday == 2 && !@isNight"
---

// The Wednesday market (clock.weekday == 2), mornings and afternoons. It is an
// `also` beat: it plays after whichever greeting wins the walk into town, or
// alone when every greeting is spent for the day. Prices come off run.money;
// the goods are bag items (::give).

## Market day

::bg{location="portvolt-market" time="day"}
::music{action="change" mood="festive" volume="normal"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: It's Wednesday, and the harbor road is all awnings: fish, fruit, bolts of cloth, and a band called Static playing too loud outside the Mart.
::auto{character="portvoltVendor" anchor="center" action="enter"}
@portvoltVendor{code="0010"}: Market day! Come and look, love. Looking's free. Buying isn't.

<hub id="eastMarketStalls" prompt="Which stall?">
  <choice id="fish" label="The fish stall: a Fresh Water bundle (200)" when="run.money >= 200" once>
    ::set{run.money -= 200}
    ::give{item="freshWater" qty="3"}
    @portvoltVendor{code="0020"}: Three bottles, fresh from the spring behind the lighthouse. Your monsters will thank you.
  </choice>
  <choice id="stone" label="The curio stall: a Thunder Stone (2100)" when="run.money >= 2100" once>
    ::set{run.money -= 2100}
    ::give{item="thunderStone"}
    @narrator{code="0020"}: The curio seller wraps the stone in three layers of rubber and still flinches handing it over.
  </choice>
  <choice id="charm" label="Marta's stall: a lucky net float (500)" when="run.money >= 500" once>
    ::set{run.money -= 500}
    ::give{item="luckyFloat"}
    @portvoltVendor{code="0030"}: My first customer today! Hang it on your bag. Fishermen swear by them. Fishermen swear by everything, mind.
  </choice>
  <choice id="band" label="Listen to the band">
    @narrator{code="0030"}: Static plays the same four chords, very loudly, with great conviction. The rocker from the Spark Gym is on guitar.
  </choice>
  <choice id="leave" label="Head on" exit>
    @portvoltVendor{code="0040"}: Come back next Wednesday!
  </choice>
</hub>
